  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FRIDA | The Young Feminist Fund is the world&apos;s first and only youth-led fund dedicated to young feminist organizing. Their mission is to provide accessible and strategic flexible/core funding for newly established young feminist-led initiatives; to strengthen the capacity of young feminist organizations to leverage additional resources for their work and enhance their impact; and to increase commitments of donors and allies to resourcing young feminist activism. FRIDA | The Young Feminist Fund operates globally.</narrative>
